<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold;">**See:**</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \`/shared/vocabulary/master.csv\`</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> (Filter by Lesson A1-05)</span></span>
